{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38885","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:44.230447+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"@mattjj \n","created_at":"2026-07-01T12:48:54Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/38885#issuecomment-4855021933","id":4855021933,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38885","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABIWHBbQ","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4855021933/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-07-01T12:48:54Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4855021933","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10237782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sbodenstein","id":10237782,"login":"sbodenstein","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjM3Nzgy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sbodenstein","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"### Description\n\nWith BF16 inputs:\n```\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\n\njax.config.update(\"jax_allow_f16_reductions\", False)\nx = jnp.ones((100,), dtype=jnp.bfloat16)\nf = jax.jit(jax.grad(jnp.max))\nf(x)\n```\nfails with\n```\n[google3/third_party/py/jax/_src/lax/lax.py](https://colab.corp.google.com/drive/1d-RElSsJRqBWB_U2hnKUq5r8eJjn6ucM#) in _reduce_sum_dtype_rule(operand, axes, **_)\n   8432       not config.allow_f16_reductions.value and\n   8433       not all(core.definitely_equal(operand.shape[d], 1) for d in axes)):\n-> 8434     raise ValueError(f\"reduce_sum on operand {operand.str_short(True)} is not \"\n   8435                      \"allowed when jax_allow_f16_reductions=False.\")\n   8436   return dt\n\nValueError: reduce_sum on operand bf16[100] is not allowed when jax_allow_f16_reductions=False.\n```\nThe cause: the `jnp.max` VJP needs to count the number of values in the array that have exactly the max value, and divide by this count. The implementation checks for equality, producing a bool array, then sums the bool array, which is then erroneously done in BF16, rather than an integer type appropriate for counts. This could lead to unstable numerics. This might be even worse for lower precision types (FP8/FP4). \n\nNote that `jnp.count_nonzero` is effectively what the VJP needs to call, and this implementation does the correct thing (casts the bool array to an integer array before reducing to count, rather than cast to the input type).\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.11.0\njaxlib: 0.11.0\nnumpy:  2.4.6\npython: 3.13.11\n```","closed_at":null,"closed_by":null,"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38885/comments","created_at":"2026-07-01T12:48:41Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38885/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/38885","id":4785665438,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d