url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mattjj","id":1458824,"login":"mattjj","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0NTg4MjQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mattjj","user_view_type":"public"},"commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-07-01T12:48:56Z","event":"subscribed","id":27429092598,"node_id":"SE_lADOCTkjjc8AAAABHT91ns8AAAAGYua89g","performed_via_github_app":null,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/events/27429092598"},{"actor":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100948359?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/coder-jayp","id":100948359,"login":"coder-jayp","node_id":"U_kgDOBgRZhw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coder-jayp","user_view_type":"public"},"created_at":"2026-07-02T14:20:42Z","event":"cross-referenced","source":{"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"Fixes #38885\r\n\r\n**The Problem:**\r\nWhen computing the VJP of `jnp.max` or `jnp.min` on low-precision inputs (`bfloat16` or `float16`), the VJP implementation was previously performing sum reductions natively in that low precision format to both count ties and compute the weighted gradient sum. \r\n\r\nThis resulted in two problems\r\n1. It crashed with a `ValueError` when `jax.config.update(\"jax_allow_f16_reductions\", False)` was set. \r\n2. It caused severe numerical instability for large arrays (e.g., `bfloat16` loses integer counting precision at 256).\r\n\r\n**The Solution:**\r\nUpdated `_reduce_chooser_jvp_rule` in `lax.py` to safely handle low-precision gradients:\r\n- **Ties Counting:** The boolean indicator array is now cast to `int32` before reduction, ensuring exact counting without precision loss.\r\n- **Weighted Gradient Sum:** If the incoming gradient is `float16` or `bfloat16`, the reduction is promoted to `float32` during accumulation and then cast back to the target dtype at the end. \r\n\r\nThis fully bypasses the `allow_f16_reductions` restriction and yields highly accurate gradients.\r\n\r\n**Testing:**\r\n- Added a robust regression test to `tests/api_test.py` covering both `jnp.max` and `jnp.min` under `jax.allow_f16_reductions(False)` for unique and tied elements.\r\n- Passes all `pre-commit` and local pytest checks.\r\n","closed_at":null,"comments":0,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38902/comments","created_at":"2026-07-02T14:20:41Z","draft":false,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38902/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/pull/38902","id":4795309869,"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/38902/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":